UnitDenseQueue::Append
├── when the queue holds live entries
│   ├── it should issue the id after the tail
│   ├── it should count the new entry in
│   └── it should leave the head where it is
├── when the queue is empty and the head is zero
│   └── it should point the head at the new entry
└── when the queue is empty and the head was left on a consumed entry
    └── it should point the head at the new entry
